;; The macOS counterpart of the Linux offline-sandbox job (issue #1333): the
;; whole offline lane runs with every network operation denied while file and
;; process access stay allowed. sandbox-exec is deprecated by Apple but
;; remains the only runner-level mechanism on hosted macOS; this profile is
;; repository-owned so any loosening is reviewable in diffs.
(version 1)
(allow default)
(deny network*)
(deny network-outbound)
(deny network-inbound)
(deny system-socket)
